It is built on the following open models and libraries, each under its own license. Model weights are
downloaded at runtime (Hugging Face, or download.moonshine.ai for Moonshine) and are not part of this
repository.

Models used by default
- Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 (language model), Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud. Apache License 2.0.
  Downloaded as mlx-community/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507-4bit. https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507
- Kokoro-82M (voice), hexgrad. Apache License 2.0. https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  Downloaded as the MLX conversion prince-canuma/Kokoro-82M.
- Moonshine streaming, English (speech recognition), Moonshine AI / Useful Sensors. MIT License for the English
  models, downloaded from download.moonshine.ai. Moonshine models for other languages are under the
  non-commercial Moonshine Community License and are not used.
- Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 (dictation, commands and chat), NVIDIA. Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC-BY-4.0).
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 ; used as the MLX conversion
  mlx-community/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 (converted to MLX; weights cast to bfloat16 at load time).
- Silero VAD (voice activity detection), Silero Team. MIT License. https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
- spaCy en_core_web_sm (used by misaki for English text-to-phonemes), Explosion. MIT License.
- LiveKit turn detector (end-of-turn model, livekit/turn-detector v1.2.2-en), LiveKit, Inc. LiveKit Model
  License: free and usable commercially, but only together with the LiveKit Agents framework, not to develop
  other models, and redistribution only under the same terms with its notice. Not an OSI license, not
  redistributed here (LiveKit Agents downloads it). https://huggingface.co/livekit/turn-detector
- livekit-local-inference (installed with LiveKit Agents 1.8): Apache License 2.0 code with an embedded model
  under the LiveKit Model License (above).

Models used on demand or optional
- WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM (speaker verification, "listen only to my voice", off by default), Wespeaker project.
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC-BY-4.0). https://huggingface.co/Wespeaker/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM
  Features computed with kaldi-native-fbank (Apache License 2.0).
- Whisper large-v3-turbo (dictation fallback when Parakeet picks the wrong language), OpenAI. MIT License.
  Used as mlx-community/whisper-large-v3-turbo-8bit (converted to MLX) with openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo's
  processor files.
- Qwen3-TTS 0.6B / 1.7B CustomVoice (expressive voices), Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud. Apache License 2.0.
  Used as mlx-community/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-CustomVoice-8bit and -1.7B-CustomVoice-8bit.
- Chatterbox Turbo (voice), Resemble AI. MIT License. Used as mlx-community/chatterbox-turbo-8bit.
- Language models selectable in the settings, under their own licenses:
  Apache License 2.0: Qwen2.5 0.5B / 1.5B / 7B Instruct, Qwen3 4B, Qwen3.5 2B / 4B, MiniCPM5 2B (OpenBMB).
  Restricted: Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct (Qwen Research License, no commercial use); LFM2.5-1.2B (Liquid AI, LFM Open
  License v1.0, commercial use limited above a revenue threshold); Llama 3.2 1B / 3B (Meta, Llama 3.2 Community
  License, "Built with Llama"); Gemma 3 1B / 4B (Google, Gemma Terms of Use).

